# Base URL of the FastAPI backend (Mini Banking System).
# Local dev default matches the currently running instance.
# For the lab environment, change this to your own assigned
# http://<server>:<port>/<username> per initialize.md Section 6-7.
#
# NOTE: @quasar/app-vite exposes client-side env vars under the QCLI_ prefix
# (not Vite's usual VITE_ prefix) — see quasar.config.js -> build -> env.
# Previous local value (kept for reference):
# QCLI_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8090/appdev1/
QCLI_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000